y_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19966, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JzC3GPo9U4EgbbxMqBsyjb", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19966, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GHFR5638yzannpAfmhJ1We", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20266, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GHFR5638yzannpAfmhJ1We", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20266, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GHFR5638yzannpAfmhJ1We", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25231, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01L6uiGhFNHSSmZNavPK8KGe", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed: the orchestrator error halted the rollout after us-east, leaving regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Post-rollback: all regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up needed: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator error. Also look at why a release that was unhealthy in staging was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55831, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01L6uiGhFNHSSmZNavPK8KGe", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55831, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01L6uiGhFNHSSmZNavPK8KGe", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57515, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PcsFqc4vL6Yajpcx3zZhcj", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57815, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PcsFqc4vL6Yajpcx3zZhcj", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57815, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PcsFqc4vL6Yajpcx3zZhcj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 63551, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and the SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in every region with an 18% error rate.\n- I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The approval policy didn't apply because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before.\n- The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after updating us-east, which left the regions on different versions. Rolling back to a fixed version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again and it finished in all regions.\n- Current status: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create it timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found it had been created, so there's only one.\n- It pages on-call and describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current status.\n- It lists three follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error.\n  - Find out how v2.3.1 reached production when its release candidate had already failed health checks in staging.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WvARjHVNMv8DUecMunJFVT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XoJbK56aW3gRqNtR2nQmqb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GfC8XErsCWPsxk41vs4JuE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01H3cQsXyWiw8hernYF6VZxe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only finished in us-east. Rolling to a fixed version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FGFhHFR911n5VQA54gvWLZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JzC3GPo9U4EgbbxMqBsyjb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01GHFR5638yzannpAfmhJ1We", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01L6uiGhFNHSSmZNavPK8KGe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed: the orchestrator error halted the rollout after us-east, leaving regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Post-rollback: all regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up needed: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator error. Also look at why a release that was unhealthy in staging was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01PcsFqc4vL6Yajpcx3zZhcj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), and the SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in every region with an 18% error rate.\n- I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The approval policy didn't apply because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before.\n- The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after updating us-east, which left the regions on different versions. Rolling back to a fixed version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again and it finished in all regions.\n- Current status: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create it timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found it had been created, so there's only one.\n- It pages on-call and describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current status.\n- It lists three follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error.\n  - Find out how v2.3.1 reached production when its release candidate had already failed health checks in staging.", "type": "text"}]}]}